 *** what is redux toolkit ? ***
    ------------------------


redux oolkit ek react ki ek official  laibrary hai jo React application me state managment ko simple fast aur efficient bnaane ke liye use hota hai 

redux toolkit ek tool hai jo app ke data o manage krta hai code ko short aur easy bna deta hai.

redux toolkit =>
   Redux toolkit redux ka official aur recommended tarika hai jisase hum redux logi ko esay aur kam code me likh skte hai 

   redux toolkit ek modern tool hai jo redux ko simple fast aur easy bana deta hai with less code.

redux toolkit ko download krne ke liye terminal ke ander ka command--
 npm install @redux/toolkit =>(oficial modern library) redux install krne ke liye 
 npm install react-redux ==>(binds redux to react) redux toolkit ke sath install hoga.


   
