**Slice**
slice redux toolkit ka ek part hota hau jo state, reducers aur action ko ek hi jagah define krta hai 
slice ==> state ka chotta part + uska logic + action

*Action*
 Action ek object hota hai jo btata hai ki state me kya change karna hai (state ke sath kya krna hai.. )

 